WEBVTT

00:24:58.236 --> 00:25:00.116
RW: For parents,

00:25:00.876 --> 00:25:06.556
it’s really helping your children
to pay attention

00:25:06.556 --> 00:25:09.236
to how they feel

00:25:09.276 --> 00:25:14.596
and to learn to use their feelings
with more choice.

00:25:14.596 --> 00:25:19.276
So learning to love what they love
and hang on to what they love,

00:25:19.316 --> 00:25:21.236
even if it's not so popular.

00:25:21.756 --> 00:25:24.596
You know, I had a mother talk to me

00:25:24.636 --> 00:25:29.036
about how her child really loved
doing improv comedy.

00:25:29.036 --> 00:25:30.596
And he’s only 12,